It'd be great to have some code in dev mode to produce a console.warn in case an invalid parameter is provided (vs silently ignoring it), i.e. something like this:

```
    if (validParams.has(param)) {
      url.searchParams.set(validParams.get(param)!, value.toString());
    } else {
      if (ngDevMode) {
        console.warn(formatRuntimeError(RuntimeErrorCode.INVALID_LOADER_ARGUMENTS, '...'));
      }
    }
```
